---
module: cycle_graph
func_id: find-strongly-connected-components
---

***conformance tests***

# components-of-mixed-graph
The :Graph: a→[b], b→[a, c], c→[d], d→[c], e→[] has the components {a, b}, {c, d} and {e}.

# successor-only-node-is-a-component
The :Graph: a→[b] has the components {a} and {b}.

# long-chain
The :Graph: of a chain 0→1→…→n with n twice the Python recursion limit has n + 1 components.

***acceptance tests***
